    <!-- Demo identifiers for 5 students.
         Values are obviously fake — they exist only to demonstrate
         the encrypted identifier storage. Encryption happens at the
         Python model level so values here go through the normal ORM path.

         NOTE: Identifier type codes are seeded by country modules (e.g. esmis_ph).
         These demo records reference esmis_vocabulary.code_gender_male as a placeholder
         type_id since no PH identifier type codes exist in this base module.
         Real deployments use esmis_ph which seeds PhilSys, LRN, etc.

         This demo file is intentionally minimal — it documents the structure
         and will be populated by country module demo data.
    -->

    <!-- No demo identifier records are created in the base module because
         identifier type vocabulary codes are seeded by country-specific modules
         (e.g. esmis_ph seeds urn:esmis:identifier-type-ph codes for PhilSys, LRN, etc.).

         To add demo identifiers, create demo/demo_identifiers.xml in the
         country module that seeds the identifier type vocabulary. -->
</odoo>
